<table style="width:100%">
  <tr>
    <td style="color:#223388; font-size:150%; vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:black; font-weight:600">NIST Atomic Spectra Database Lines Data</span><p>
      <u>Ne VIII</u>: 745 Lines of Data Found<br />
<span style="font-size:larger; font-weight:bold"><i>Z</i> = 10, Li isoelectronic sequence</span><span style="font-size=300%">&nbsp;</span></p>
    </td>
    <td style="text-align:right; vertical-align:middle">
<div class='ref'>
<b>Example of how to reference these results:</b><br />

Kramida,&nbsp;A., Ralchenko,&nbsp;Yu., Reader,&nbsp;J., and NIST ASD Team (2024).
  <i>NIST Atomic Spectra Database</i> (ver.&nbsp;5.12),
  [Online]. Available: <span style="color:#0000cc;">https://physics.nist.gov/asd</span>
  [2025, March 22].
  National Institute of Standards and Technology, Gaithersburg, MD.
    DOI: <span style="color:#0000cc;">https://doi.org/10.18434/T4W30F</span>
<br />
<div style="text-align: right; font-size: x-small">
<a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popdef('/cgi-bin/ASD/bibtex.pl?y=2025&amp;m=March&amp;d=22');return true" target="_top">BibTex Citation</a> (new window)
</div>
</div>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2">&nbsp;</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2" style="color:#655665; font-family: helvetica,arial; font-size:80%"><b><u><i>&lambda;</i> in</u>: <span style="color:darkred">vacuum</span> <span style="color:navy"></span><br />
<u>Highest relative intensity</u>: 30000</b></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>
<table style="background-color:black; width:75%; border-spacing:1px" >
  <tr>
    <td colspan="3" style="color:white; font-size:10pt; width:70%; background-color:#224477; text-align:center">
      <b>Primary data sources</b>
    </td>
    <td rowspan="4">
    </td>
    <td style="white-space:nowrap; color:white; font-size:10pt; background-color:#446655; text-align:center">
      <table style="border:thin hidden;text-align:center;width:100%">
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align:center; white-space:nowrap">Query NIST Bibliographic Databases for</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align:center"><b>Ne  VIII</b> (new window)</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class='brt1'>
      Energy Levels:
    </td>
    <td class='bcn'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=9090&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=E');return false">Kramida&nbsp;&&nbsp;Buchet-Poulizac&nbsp;2006</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=22456&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=E');return false">Azarov&nbsp;et.&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2023</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=0&amp;comment_code=u57&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=E');return false">Kramida&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2024</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=0&amp;comment_code=u58&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=E');return false">Kramida&nbsp;2024</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf'>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;For the two lowest excited levels, 1s<sup>2</sup>2p<sub>1/2,3/2</sub>, the energies are from the ongoing critical analysis of <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=0&amp;comment_code=u57&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=E');return false">Kramida&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2024 </a>. They pertain to the isotope <sup>20</sup>Ne. The core-excited 1s2<i>l</i>2<i>l&prime;</i> energy levels are from the critical analysis of <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=22456&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=E');return false">Azarov&nbsp;et.&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2023 </a>. Most of them are theoretical values of <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=20125&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=E');return false">Yerokhin&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2017 </a>, but a few ones are experimental. For the quartet levels, uncertainties are given for the separation from the 1s(<sup>2</sup>S)2s2p(<sup>3</sup>P&deg;) <sup>4</sup>P<sub>3/2</sub> level. To estimate uncertainties of their excitation energies from the ground level, the given uncertainties must be combined in quadrature with 33&nbsp;cm<sup>-1</sup>, which is the uncertainty of the given theoretical value of 1s(<sup>2</sup>S)2s2p(<sup>3</sup>P&deg;) <sup>4</sup>P<sub>3/2</sub>, taken from <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=20125&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=E');return false">Yerokhin&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2017 </a>. All the other core-excited levels have been reoptimized with the least-squares level optimization code <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=15449&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=E');return false">LOPT (Kramida&nbsp;2011 </a> by <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=0&amp;comment_code=u58&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=E');return false">Kramida&nbsp;2024 </a>. This dataset was prepared by A. Kramida for the release of ASD v.5.12 in October 2024.
    </td>
    <td class='bcn1'>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Elevbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Ne%20VIII&amp;method=EL&amp;method=TE&amp;method=ND&amp;method=IP&amp;method=SF&amp;method=QF&amp;order=1');return false"
        onmouseover="self.status='Ne  VIII: bibliography energy levels query';return true;"
        onmouseout="self.status=''; return true;" target="_blank">Ne  VIII Energy Levels</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class='brt1'>
      Lines:
    </td>
    <td class='bcn'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=9090&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=L');return false">Kramida&nbsp;&&nbsp;Buchet-Poulizac&nbsp;2006</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=22456&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=L');return false">Azarov&nbsp;et.&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2023</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=0&amp;comment_code=u57&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=L');return false">Kramida&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2024</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf'>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;One line at 86.09(3)&nbsp;&Aring; from <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=23151&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=L');return false">Lapierre's thesis (Lapierre&nbsp;2000 </a>, which was tentatively classified by <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=9090&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=L');return false">Kramida&nbsp;&&nbsp;Buchet-Poulizac&nbsp;2006 </a>, has been dropped from the line list, as its observed wavelength does not agree with the newly optimized energy levels of <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=0&amp;comment_code=u58&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=L');return false">Kramida&nbsp;2024 </a>. This dataset was prepared by A. Kramida for the release of ASD v.5.12 in October 2024.
    </td>
    <td class='bcn1'>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Elevbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Ne%20VIII&amp;method=W&amp;method=CL&amp;order=1');return false"
        onmouseover="self.status='Ne  VIII: bibliography wavelengths query';return true;"
        onmouseout="self.status=''; return true;" target="_blank">Ne  VIII Line Wavelengths and Classification</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class='brt1'>
      Transition Probabilities:
    </td>
    <td class='bcn'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne VIII';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=9413&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=8&amp;type=T');return false">Reader&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;2015</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf'>
      
    </td>
    <td class='bcn1'>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Fvalbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Ne%20VIII&amp;order=1');return false"
        onmouseover="self.status='Ne  VIII: bibliography transition probability query';return true;"
        onmouseout="self.status=''; return true;" target="_blank">Ne  VIII Transition Probabilities</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
    <p>
<hr class="noshade" />

